              ‖halpernIteration T lam x x n - P[FixT, hFix_cheb] x‖ ^ (2 : ℕ) +
            3 * lam n * ε) :
    ∀ r,
      ‖halpernIteration T lam x x (m + r + 1) - P[FixT, hFix_cheb] x‖ ^ (2 : ℕ) ≤
        3 * ε +
          ‖halpernIteration T lam x x m - P[FixT, hFix_cheb] x‖ ^ (2 : ℕ) *
            ((Finset.range (r + 1)).prod fun k ↦ (1 - lam (m + k))) := by
